<body>

<h1 class="main-title">Order Management Demonstration</h1>

<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Title:</span> Order Management System</div>

<div class="meta-field"><span class="meta-label">Objective/Aim:</span><br>
To write a Java program demonstrating classes, constructors, inheritance, method implementation, and the creation and management of special and normal orders.</div>

<h2 class="section-header">System Requirements :</h2>
<div class="sub-heading">Hardware</div>
<ul>
<li>Standard PC/Laptop</li><li>Intel Core i3/i5 processor or equivalent</li><li>Minimum 4 GB RAM</li><li>Minimum 500 MB free storage</li><li>Keyboard and Monitor</li>
</ul>
<div class="sub-heading">Software</div>
<ul>
<li>Operating System: Windows/Linux/macOS</li><li>Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or JDK 21)</li>
<li>Text Editor or IDE such as Eclipse, IntelliJ IDEA, NetBeans, or VS Code</li><li>Command Prompt/Terminal</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-header">Algorithm / Logic Description:</h2>
<ol>
<li>Create a <code>Customer</code> class with <code>customerName</code> and <code>customerPlace</code> as instance variables.</li>
<li>Define <code>sendOrder()</code> and <code>receiveOrder()</code> methods inside the <code>Customer</code> class.</li>
<li>Create an <code>Order</code> base class with attributes <code>orderDate</code> and <code>orderId</code>.</li>
<li>Define <code>confirmOrder()</code> and <code>closeOrder()</code> methods inside the <code>Order</code> class.</li>
<li>Create a subclass <code>SpecialOrder</code> extending <code>Order</code>, initialize via <code>super()</code>, and define <code>dispatchOrder()</code>.</li>
<li>Create a subclass <code>NormalOrder</code> extending <code>Order</code>, initialize via <code>super()</code>, and define <code>dispatchOrder()</code> and <code>receiveNormalOrder()</code>.</li>
<li>Create the <code>OrderDemo</code> class containing the <code>main()</code> method.</li>
<li>Instantiate <code>Customer</code>, <code>SpecialOrder</code>, and <code>NormalOrder</code> objects.</li>
<li>Display customer details and invoke order processing methods for both special and normal orders.</li>
<li>Stop the program.</li>
</ol>

<div class="page-break"></div>

