<h2 class="section-header">Result:</h2>
<p>The Order Management System program was successfully implemented in Java. The program demonstrates object-oriented concepts including inheritance (base class <code>Order</code> extended by <code>SpecialOrder</code> and <code>NormalOrder</code>), constructor chaining using <code>super()</code>, method implementation, and class associations.</p>

